parameters.text:
=Write a LinkedIn post for GoFundItNow about this article.

Structure:
- Hook: 1 punchy opening line (do NOT start with an emoji)
- 2-3 lines of expert insight from GoFundItNow's perspective
- 1 line on what this means for our audience
- Soft CTA (follow our page, visit gofunditnow.com, or drop a comment)
- 3-5 relevant hashtags on the last line

Max 200 words. No fluff.

Article: {{ $json.output }}
Category: {{ $json.ai_category }}
Urgency: {{ $json.ai_urgency }}
Audience: {{ $json.ai_audience }}

